claude-dispatch
===============

claude-dispatch is a custom build of the GNU C Library's dynamic linker (ld.so).

What this repository contains:
  - rtld-dispatch.patch  — a small patch to glibc's elf/rtld.c and elf/Makefile
  - src/                 — a no_std Rust staticlib (the `claude_dispatch` hook)
  - build.sh / install.sh / Makefile — the build pipeline
  - glibc/glibc-*.tar.xz — pristine upstream glibc source (Git LFS), unmodified
  - glibc/slackware/     — Slackware's glibc patches + SlackBuild, for reference

